           Limit display to those records of the specified _a_d_d_r_e_s_s___f_a_m_i_l_y or a
           single _p_r_o_t_o_c_o_l.  The following address families and protocols are
           recognized:

           _F_a_m_i_l_y                      _P_r_o_t_o_c_o_l_s
           iinneett (AF_INET)              ddiivveerrtt, iiccmmpp, iiggmmpp, iipp, iippsseecc, ppiimm,,
                                       ssccttpp, ttccpp, uuddpp
           iinneett66 (AF_INET6)            iiccmmpp66, iipp66, iippsseecc66, rriipp66, ssccttpp, ttccpp,
                                       uuddpp
